  metaTitle: 'Electric Gate Delivery Access for Commuters Hertfordshire | Out All Day',
  metaDescription: 'Nobody home all day because the household commutes into London? How to let couriers through a Hertfordshire electric gate reliably, which entry methods survive patchy rural signal, and how to keep security intact.',
